# pipenv
#   According to pypi.org, Pipenv is not recommended for workflows that manage multiple
#   positions who have conflicting priorities with regards to whether a package
#   should be installed or not. However, if you feel that you are in the exceptional
#   minority of projects that could benefit from a pipenv do not ignore this file.
#   Some services may benefit from it, so we are adding it to the exceptions.
